<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>C.P.S Fashion Hub</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f5f5f5;color:#222}
header{background:#111;color:white;padding:18px;text-align:center}
header h1{margin:0;font-size:28px}
header p{margin:6px 0 0;color:#ddd}

.hero{background:#222;color:white;text-align:center;padding:55px 20px}
.hero h2{font-size:38px;margin:0 0 10px}
.hero p{font-size:18px;color:#ddd}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#25D366;color:white;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:15px}

.section{padding:40px 18px;max-width:1000px;margin:auto}
.section h2{text-align:center;font-size:30px}
.products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px}
.card{background:white;padding:22px;border-radius:14px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 3px 12px #0002}
.card .icon{font-size:55px}
.card h3{font-size:22px}
.card p{color:#666}
.order{display:block;background:#25D366;color:white;text-decoration:none;padding:10px;border-radius:7px;font-weight:bold}

.about{background:white;padding:25px;border-radius:14px;text-align:center}
.contact{background:#111;color:white;text-align:center}
.contact p{color:#ddd}

footer{background:#000;color:#aaa;text-align:center;padding:18px}

@media(max-width:500px){
.products{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.hero h2{font-size:30px}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>🛍️ C.P.S Fashion Hub</h1>
<p>Fashion • Style • Quality</p>
</header>

<section class="hero">
<h2>आपके हर Style के लिए</h2>
<p>All कपड़े एक ही जगह पर</p>

<a class="btn"
href="https://wa.me/919693036797?text=Namaste%20C.P.S%20Fashion%20Hub%2C%20mujhe%20aapke%20kapdon%20ke%20baare%20mein%20jaankari%20chahiye."
target="_blank">
💬 WhatsApp पर Order करें
</a>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>हमारी Collection</h2>

<div class="products">

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">👕</div>
<h3>T-Shirts</h3>
<p>Latest और stylish T-Shirts</p>
<a class="order" href="https://wa.me/919693036797?text=Mujhe%20T-Shirt%20ki%20collection%20dekhni%20hai." target="_blank">WhatsApp Order</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">👔</div>
<h3>Shirts</h3>
<p>Casual और fashionable Shirts</p>
<a class="order" href="https://wa.me/919693036797?text=Mujhe%20Shirts%20ki%20collection%20dekhni%20hai." target="_blank">WhatsApp Order</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">👖</div>
