<p>Daily wear और stylish collection</p>
<a class="order" href="https://wa.me/919693036797?text=Mujhe%20Jeans%20aur%20Pants%20ki%20collection%20dekhni%20hai." target="_blank">WhatsApp Order</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🧥</div>
<h3>All Fashion</h3>
<p>हर तरह के कपड़े उपलब्ध</p>
<a class="order" href="https://wa.me/919693036797?text=Mujhe%20aapki%20poori%20clothing%20collection%20dekhni%20hai." target="_blank">WhatsApp Order</a>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<h2>About Us</h2>

<div class="about">
<p>
<strong>C.P.S Fashion Hub</strong> में आपको अलग-अलग तरह के कपड़ों की
fashionable collection मिलेगी। Product, size और price की जानकारी के लिए
सीधे WhatsApp पर संपर्क करें।
</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section contact">
<h2>Contact Us</h2>

<p>📱 Mobile: <strong>9693036797</strong></p>

<p>
📍 Kalwara, Singhwara, Darbhanga,<br>
Bihar, India - 847104
